                    <seg rendition="#center">No. 159</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The first of the three conversations between Secretary of State Acheson and
                    Foreign Minister Schuman took place on March 29 and was concerned exclusively
                    with problems raised at the Four-Power Exploratory Talks then taking place in
                    Paris. For minutes of this first meeting, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1951v03p1/pg_1112">volume III, Part 1, page 1112</ref>.</p>
            </div>
